    ":question/id": "002482ff-69a9-5b63-b3f0-5cd70a51819a",
    ":question/problem": "Calculate $$\n\\displaystyle \\int 2 x \\csc^{2}{\\left(x^{2} \\right)}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$",
    ":question/worked-solution": "Let $u=x^{2},$ then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=2 x.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 2 x \\csc^{2}{\\left(x^{2} \\right)}\\,\\text{d}x &= 1\\int \\csc^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\ &= - \\cot{\\left(u \\right)}+C \\\\ &= - \\cot{\\left(x^{2} \\right)}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"
  },
